	(text "I2C1 pull-ups: the CM4 pulls GPIO2/3 up with 1.8 kΩ. H5/H6 can add\nR20/R21 (2.2 kΩ, normally open) on the CM4 Connectors sheet.\nThere are no pull-ups on this sheet. Off-board sensors (e.g. Adafruit\nbreakouts) often carry their own; keep the parallel total above ~1 kΩ\nso a 3 mA sink still pulls the bus to 0.4 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 145.796 77.724 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "084c3f58-bbf2-4d75-a999-0d1bea26d796")
	)
